ecial cases:** besides the standard names, I added `robot`, `cannot_answer` and `change_recorded_promise`. All three reply and continue the call.\n- **Second persuasion attempt (late band):** it always proposes the minimum amount on the deadline, so I set its `floor_if_full_refused` to false."}
